{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a686a6230dbc40c2197afe5bb6149008db4826e0636f986d21d5bd0b03eb8f28",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a3f46ae8b153b8a74eb27a5c10b99f738c48956e6703ca1a8f6725d79c3a87",
      "text": "……然后呢，就和事务所的老板大吵了一架。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:924eeeed4f0da5c1ecaaea5b46acb150de19b5bbb2061a3eceae3d191efb7e2f",
      "text": "与其说是顺势辞职，\n不如说是几乎直接摔门跑出来的感觉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a0902f14f3bf80048a10f3eca84ebb5f81c43c7e1022f58b4469c17e051b924",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n所以，现在是以自由执业者的身份在工作吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:116dc5c2067fe09e7e39de58bf3e196e1fdbafad5413c0596906911247e3b931",
      "text": "啊啊。……不对，根本算不上在工作吧。\n今天也是连一单委托都没接到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:018736bf67e89f2522a45808f1b94a3cd72ba209ec0164ed258da13a58716de2",
      "text": "完全不顺利啊……\n这种事情，光靠干劲也是没办法的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731723888f8905640e734063ae2882e5f82e9c272c3325791bd7edaa66304a18",
      "text": "不好意思，我可以问您一个问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a8be0aafdb3766b399141ba49054d927193481a25ee2da6b0c5a3a583ddd863",
      "text": "辉先生，刚才说过对吧。\n“想要成为正义的英雄”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17863561694756878f925b285baf6490caf218d3c249aa0a929df7571ebfaf73",
      "text": "放弃那个梦想……您没有考虑过这种选项吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44d55d118a3e6866d4a27b60ce3219b3d7f5ecf068304d65b700a95b1855f202",
      "text": "那个嘛……没有吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51ec3fddd5f2fb78dca2863ef4f2132165eaeac426a140d0f376f7268ba1a367",
      "text": "跑出事务所的时候，我就发过誓了。\n无论多么痛苦，都要堂堂正正、坦率正直地活下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
